Apache-2.0, as declared by @mathjax/mathjax-tex-font package metadata.

The MathJax SVG module also imports default font data from
@mathjax/mathjax-newcm-font 4.1.3 (Apache-2.0). These transitive data are bundled;
the configured output font is MathJax TeX and requires no dynamic font loads.

Build sources, exact versions and lockfile: tools/mathjax/.
This project adds an offline JSON-lines interface, isolated per-formula parsing,
resource limits and explicit unrecognized-command diagnostics.
